                        "description": "Recurrent and persistent thoughts, urges, or images that are experienced as intrusive and unwanted, and attempts to ignore or suppress them.",
                        "subtypes": {
                            "Contamination Obsessions": "Recurrent and intrusive worries about contamination, germs, or dirt.",
                            "Pathological Doubt": "Pathological doubt regarding safety or mistakes, such as whether doors are locked or gas valves are closed.",
                            "Symmetry and Exactness Obsessions": "A strong urge that items must be lined up exactly or be symmetrical.",
                            "Forbidden or Taboo Thoughts": "Intrusive thoughts involving aggressive (harming others), sexual, or religious content that are prohibited.",
